{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c42669b0-bcc0-88a6-85cb-8eec78625907",
  "created_at": "2026-01-10T08:46:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "George Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:43:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine. I know it's Saturday morning, so you've caught the after-hours line. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:43:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. I know City Hall's closed, that's why I'm calling this number. It's George Sherman. I'm on Bridge Street, down the Point. Again with the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:43:26-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Sherman, I'm sorry to hear that. What's the address on Bridge Street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:43:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One ninety-eight. One ninety-eight Bridge Street. [line breaks up] the storm drain at the bottom is plugged solid."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:43:40-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I lost you for a second there. You said the storm drain at the bottom is plugged? Can you say that once more?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:43:50-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The drain. It's clogged. Every time it rains hard the water comes down the hill from the next street over and runs straight into my yard. Straight in. Nobody ever does anything about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:44:04-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So the water comes off the hill from the next street, runs down, and ends up in your yard at one ninety-eight Bridge Street. Is that from this storm, the one that came in Friday and wrapped up today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:44:19-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that one. It's still sitting out there. Hold on, my grandson's showing me a video on his phone, I'm not even looking at the road, he's got it from the front window. [pause] Yeah, you can see it pouring right down. Hang on, buddy, I'm on the phone."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:44:38-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, take your time. Is anyone in the house in danger, or is it mostly the yard and the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:44:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yard and the street. It's not in the house right now. But I've got pictures, plenty of them. I took them this morning. I can send them to you if you want."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:45:00-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd like that, yes. Let me think how best to do it. Do you have an email, or should I have someone call you back with where to send them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:45:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just have somebody call me. It's four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:45:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-one. Got it. And what exactly would you like the crew to do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:45:23-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Clean the drain. That's all I'm asking. Get somebody out there to clear it so the water has somewhere to go. [line breaks up] [inaudible] told me that before."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:45:35-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I missed part of that. You said somebody told you that before?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:45:40-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I said I've been calling about this drain for a while and it's still clogged. That's all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:45:47-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'm putting it down as a request to clean the storm drain at the bottom of the hill near one ninety-eight Bridge Street, water running off the next street into your yard, photos available, callback at that number. Crews are stretched thin right after a storm like this, so I can't give you an hour, but I'll mark it for follow-up first thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:46:12-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'll believe it when I see a truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:46:16-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fair. If it gets into the house or the water starts rising toward the door, call this line right back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:46:25-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Okay. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-10T08:46:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Sherman. Take care."
    }
  ],
